          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "dosageInstruction": [
          {
            "text": "Backup option if hyoscine is ineffective or poorly tolerated. Take 1 tablet by mouth 1–2 hours before travel as needed for motion sickness; may repeat every 6–8 hours; maximum 4 tablets in 24 hours. Use only as a passenger; do not drive or operate machinery if taken.",
